    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d482-a2">

                <pb facs="0648" n="542" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg542"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Dawson to
                        the Dominican Minister of Foreign
                    Affairs.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Santo
                                Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-12-26"><hi rendition="#italic">December 26,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Minister</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge
                    the receipt of your note of yesterday inclosing a copy of the resolution of the
                    council of secretaries of state taken on account of the departure of President
                    Morales.</p>
                <pb facs="0649" n="543" xml:id="pg543"/>
                <p>I shall immediately transmit its contents to my Government, and upon receiving
                    the instructions that may be sent me will communicate with you further in answer
                    to your note.</p>
                <p>In the meantime I improve the opportunity to renew, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">T. C. Dawson.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
